---
title: Caesar cipher
tags: tools
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    A very simple method of encryption, the Caesar cipher - also known as a shift cipher - 'shifts' the alphabet a certain number of spaces, pushing the letters at the end to the beginning.
    The most common Caesar cipher is Rot 13, where 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">A</code> 
    becomes 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">N</code> 
    and so forth. You can optionally add a key to the cipher to further encrypt your results, this will create a custom alphabet to rotate through &ndash;
     see the <a href="/ciphers/substitution" class="text-convrtr">Substitution Cipher</a> below for more information.
</p>
<p class="px-2">
     There is more information available on the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caesar_cipher" class="text-convrtr">Caesar_cipher</a> Wikipedia page. 
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
<ul class="pagination justify-content-center flex-wrap" id="pagination" data-pagefind-ignore="all">
    {% for char in alpha -%}
        {% if loop.first -%}
        <li class="page-item">
            <button type="button" class="page-link" id="{{ filename }}Prev" aria-label="Previous" 
                    data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Previous">
                <span aria-hidden="true">&laquo;</span>
            </button>
        </li>
        {% endif -%}
        <li class="page-item">
            <button type="button" class="page-link {{ filename }}-link" id="{{ filename }}{{ loop.index }}" 
                aria-label="Letter {{ char.letter | lower }} - Rot {{ loop.index }}" data-{{ filename }}-number="{{ loop.index }}" 
                data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Rot {{ loop.index }}">
                <span class="visually-hidden">Letter</span> {{ char.letter | lower }}<span class="visually-hidden"> - Rot {{ loop.index }}</span>
            </button>
        </li>
        {% if loop.last -%}
        <li class="page-item">
            <button type="button" class="page-link" id="{{ filename }}Next" aria-label="Next" 
                    data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Next">
                <span aria-hidden="true">&raquo;</span>
            </button>
        </li>
        {% endif -%}
    {% endfor -%}
</ul>
<div class="col">
    <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label visually-hidden">{{ filename | capitalize }} cipher</span>
        <div class="card-body text-center">
            <label for="{{ filename }}Text" class="visually-hidden">{{ filename | capitalize }} Text - text to substitute</label>
            <textarea placeholder="Example: Hello &srarr; Mjqqt (Rot 5)" rows="6" id="{{ filename }}Text" class="form-control {{ filename }}-text" autocomplete="off"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer py-3">
            <div class="text-center mb-4 g-0">
                <div class="row row-cols-2 g-md-0 gx-0 gy-2">
                    <div class="col col-12 col-md-auto">
                        <div class="input-group w-auto">
                            <label class="input-group-text" id="{{ filename }}-group" for="{{ filename }}Key"><span class="visually-hidden">{{ filename | capitalize }} Cipher </span>Key</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="{{ filename }}Key" autocomplete="off" pattern="[A-Za-z]*" title="Only letters allowed" aria-describedby="{{ filename }}-help">
                            <span class="visually-hidden" id="{{ filename }}-help">Only letters are allowed in this box, both uppercase and lowercase are valid.</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-auto flex-fill">
                        <div class="row row-cols-auto g-0">
                            <div class="col col-8 col-sm-auto ms-0 mx-md-2 me-auto">
                                <div class="form-check form-switch text-start">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="chainRots" aria-checked="false" aria-labelledby="chainRotsLabel">
                                    <label class="form-check-label" id="chainRotsLabel" for="chainRots">Chain <span class="visually-hidden">rotation </span>commands</label>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col d-flex flex-fill justify-content-end">
                                {% include "components/select-copy-dl.njk" %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr />
            <div id="{{ filename }}Results" class="data-to-copy active convrtr-results"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endcall %}
